<?xml version="1.0"?>
<rdf:RDF xmlns="http://www.semanticweb.org/francesco/ontologies/2025/2/untitled-ontology-128/"
     xml:base="http://www.semanticweb.org/francesco/ontologies/2025/2/untitled-ontology-128/"
     xmlns:db="https://w3id.org/DOLCE/OWL/DOLCEbasic#"
     xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"
     xmlns:owl="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#"
     xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#"
     xmlns:xml="http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace"
     xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#"
     xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#"
     xmlns:skos="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#"
     xmlns:vann="http://purl.org/vocab/vann/"
     xmlns:fumco="https://www.w3id.org/fumco/"
     xmlns:malfo="https://www.w3id.org/malfo/"
     xmlns:swrla="http://swrl.stanford.edu/ontologies/3.3/swrla.owl#"
     xmlns:terms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/"
     xmlns:ace_lexicon="http://attempto.ifi.uzh.ch/ace_lexicon#"
     xmlns:AnnotationVocabulary="https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/meta/AnnotationVocabulary/">
    <owl:Ontology rdf:about="https://www.w3id.org/MALFO/DOLCE-alignments">
        <owl:imports rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/fumco/1.1"/>
        <owl:imports rdf:resource="https://www.w3id.org/malfo/1.3"/>
        <rdfs:comment>Care has been taken that MALFO (https://www.w3id.org/MALFO) is an ontological module that can be aligned with ease with other ontologies, in the sense that the eventual mappings between MALFO and the other ontologies should be small. 

This file examplifies the intended alignment of MALFO with DOLCE and with a DOLCE-based functional ontology (FUMCO -- FUnction, Methods, and Capabilities Ontology) (https://github.com/kataph/FUMCO). 
The version of DOLCE-owl used is DOLCE basic (https://github.com/appliedontolab/DOLCE/blob/main/OWL/DOLCEbasic.owl), the one originarily imported by the functions ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Ontology>
    


    <!-- 
    ///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
    //
    // Object Properties
    //
    ///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
     -->

    


    <!-- https://www.w3id.org/malfo/functionalIncompatibleWith -->

    <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.w3id.org/malfo/functionalIncompatibleWith">
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.w3id.org/fumco/SystemicFunction"/>
        <owl:propertyChainAxiom rdf:parseType="Collection">
            <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.w3id.org/malfo/incompatibleWith"/>
            <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.w3id.org/fumco/classified-by"/>
            <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.w3id.org/fumco/systemic-function-of"/>
            <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.w3id.org/fumco/participates-in"/>
        </owl:propertyChainAxiom>
        <rdfs:comment>Using the FOL theory of the DOLCE-based theory of functions this relation can be defined as follows:

functionIncompatible(x, f) := ∃o, b, t(participatesIn(o, x, t) ∧
systemicFunctionOf(f, o) ∧ CF(b, f, t) ∧ incompatibleWith(x, b))

However, OWL is not enough expressive to writhe such an axiom. Therefore, in this mapping, we only add the fact that the range of the relation is the class &quot;Systemic Function&quot; and the chain 
&quot;incompatibleWith o classified-by o systemic-function-of o participates-in -&gt; functionIncompatible&quot;
which is consists of the sufficient part of the definition, where the ternary predicates have been replaced by appropriate de-temporalized predicates.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>functional incompatoble with</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    


    <!-- 
    ///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
    //
    // Classes
    //
    ///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
     -->

    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/DOLCE/OWL/DOLCEbasic#Event -->

    <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/DOLCE/OWL/DOLCEbasic#Event">
        <owl:equivalentClass rdf:resource="https://www.w3id.org/malfo/Event"/>
    </rdf:Description>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/DOLCE/OWL/DOLCEbasic#Perdurant -->

    <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/DOLCE/OWL/DOLCEbasic#Perdurant">
        <owl:equivalentClass rdf:resource="https://www.w3id.org/malfo/Occurrent"/>
    </rdf:Description>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/DOLCE/OWL/DOLCEbasic#Process -->

    <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/DOLCE/OWL/DOLCEbasic#Process">
        <owl:equivalentClass rdf:resource="https://www.w3id.org/malfo/Process"/>
    </rdf:Description>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/DOLCE/OWL/DOLCEbasic#State -->

    <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/DOLCE/OWL/DOLCEbasic#State">
        <owl:equivalentClass rdf:resource="https://www.w3id.org/malfo/State"/>
    </rdf:Description>
</rdf:RDF>



